From: Easy Buy <122056680+Volttaik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 01:16:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add hide-creator mute endpoint and exclude hidden
 creators/posts from feeds
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- POST /users/:username/mute (idempotent) persists a viewer's hide-creator
  preference in muted_users
- Feeds (home, generic posts, videos, shorts, explore content + creator
  catalog) exclude muted/blocked creators and hidden posts server-side so
  Not Interested / Hide Creator / Block preferences stick across refreshes
- Posts feed rows now return subscribed_to_creator so the client can gate
  discovery actions for creators the viewer already subscribes to

